# RC Low-Pass Filter
# First Order System
#
# Circuit: voltage source -> R -> C -> ground
# Output: voltage across capacitor Vc(p)
#
# H(p) = 1 / (1 + RCp)
#
# R = 1000 ohms, C = 1e-3 F
# K = 1, tau = RC = 1.0 s
#
# Numerator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
: 1
# Denominator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
:: 1 1.0
